    "teach_2": {
      "id": "teach_2",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Now the clue tells us what happens to the number.\n\n'Five times a number, minus 12, is 18 more than twice the number.'\n\nTranslate each phrase before calculating.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
      },
      "transitions": [
        {
          "targetNodeId": "teach_2_step"
        }
      ]
    },
    "teach_2_step": {
      "id": "teach_2_step",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Let the number be x.\n\nFive times the number, minus 12: 5x − 12\n18 more than twice the number: 2x + 18\n\n5x − 12 = 2x + 18\n3x = 30\nx = 10",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
      },
      "transitions": [
        {
          "targetNodeId": "q_2"
        }
      ]
    },
