      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Let the starting number be x.\n\n3(2x + 7) = 81\n2x + 7 = 27\n2x = 20\nx = 10\n\nNotice how the brackets keep the order of the story.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
      },
      "transitions": [
        {
          "targetNodeId": "q_4"
        }
